{"about_the_game":"<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1552930/extras/LogoDuTitreEvasilix_V3_575.png?t=1638830169\" /><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Game Description</strong></h2><br>Control B-854, a brand-new testing robot coming right from the factory, created to be put at test in a huge facility filled with testing rooms, deadly traps, trains, and secrets!<br>Jump, dash, roll, and run with a unique movement system as you progress into the games and unfold the truth that lies behind evasilix!<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1552930/extras/EvasilixScreenshot01Steam_SmallerSmallerV2.png?t=1638830169\" /><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> <h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>A new way to play</strong></h2>Control your character differently than from other games, with the unique movements system that comes with evasilix! <br>On the left side of your screen, you will see various buttons that you can interact with your keyboard, each button representing one movement. By default, you select a movement with WASD and Trigger it with SPACE.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1552930/extras/MouvementGifV2.gif?t=1638830169\" /><br><br>This system allows you to have a unique learning progression from level to level, putting your skill and your adaptation to test from easy to hard.<br><br></li><li> <h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>25 unique levels</strong></h2>Face more than 25 levels, each having their unique layers and mechanics! Those levels include parkours, boss, and even train levels!<br>If you are stuck in one level, don't worry! You can do the levels of a same area in the order you want!<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1552930/extras/EvasilixScreenshotDescription01.png?t=1638830169\" /><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1552930/extras/EvasilixScreenshotDescription02.png?t=1638830169\" /><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1552930/extras/EvasilixScreenshotDescription03.png?t=1638830169\" /><br><br></li><li> <h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>A huge HUB filled with secrets</strong></h2>Explore a huge hub divided into 6 areas, each of them having their ambiance and style. This hub is also filled with a vast quantity of secrets of all kinds: puzzles, mazes, monsters, and other weird stuff... So keep your eyes open!<br><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1552930/extras/EvasilixScreenshotDescription04.png?t=1638830169\" /><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1552930/extras/EvasilixScreenshotDescription10.png?t=1638830169\" /><br><br></li><li> <h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>4 difficulty modes</strong></h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Normal<br></li><li> Impossible: Middle respawn removed, traps added, and more<br></li><li> Mirror Normal: World inverted!<br></li><li> Mirror Impossible: The hardest way to play the game, impossible + mirror combined</li></ul> <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1552930/extras/EvasilixScreenshotDescription09.png?t=1638830169\" /><br><br>This allows you to have great replayability, especially if you are always looking for a harder challenge!<br><br></li><li> <h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>35 minutes long &quot;movie&quot;</strong></h2><br>Have you ever heard about the most intelligent living form called X1218?<br>As you progress into the game, unfold the story of X and reveal the truth that lies behind Evasilix!<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1552930/extras/EvasilixScreenshotDescription06.png?t=1638830169\" /><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1552930/extras/EvasilixScreenshotDescription07.png?t=1638830169\" /></li></ul><br><strong>Do you have what it takes for Evasilix?</strong>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Zone01","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1552930/baa48f2e603b91c6d04cc7a44622f2e665a07c1c.jpg"},{"name":"Zone02","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1552930/dee3f142815f19ad10640589b7f705f539d6a7ac.jpg"},{"name":"Zone03","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1552930/622b4e171cffb5293de0e04f17714a5a7b94fdf8.jpg"},{"name":"Zone04","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1552930/042411c88a1cc9a3daf91424ebf708fa6a952d32.jpg"},{"name":"Zone05","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1552930/82bc33012f873185d213c0239931a8e9615738d8.jpg"},{"name":"Zone06","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1552930/90d64a38eb80f30ce0743f2b9147c23e54a68d2b.jpg"},{"name":"1 Secret Found","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1552930/a528b9e2eedbbe80d0de89fd9b1f1727cc439433.jpg"},{"name":"3 Secrets Found","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1552930/3dd94f81691feb062b6c8167a596c0c48fafc928.jpg"},{"name":"6 Secrets Found","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1552930/3a128111340dfadecf232601e20fee22dc325fe3.jpg"},{"name":"9 Secrets Found","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1552930/2dc04f46d03b1201557b6204075d52d4522c3598.jpg"}],"total":27},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1552930?t=1638830169","b