lay the game, impossible + mirror combined</li></ul> <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1552930/extras/EvasilixScreenshotDescription09.png?t=1638830169\" /><br><br>This allows you to have great replayability, especially if you are always looking for a harder challenge!<br><br></li><li> <h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>35 minutes long &quot;movie&quot;</strong></h2><br>Have you ever heard about the most intelligent living form called X1218?<br>As you progress into the game, unfold the story of X and reveal the truth that lies behind Evasilix!<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1552930/extras/EvasilixScreenshotDescription06.png?t=1638830169\" /><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1552930/extras/EvasilixScreenshotDescription07.png?t=1638830169\" /></li></ul><br><strong>Do you have what it takes for Evasilix?</strong>","developers":["Obstenatis"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1552930/header.jpg?t=1638830169","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2021 Obstenatis. All Rights Reserved. Evasilix, Obstenatis and the Obstenatis logo are trademarks of Obstenatis.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":256863419,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/256863419/movie480.mp4?t=1638637902","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/256863419/movie_max.mp4?t=1638637902"},"name":"Launch Trailer - Evasilix","thumbnail":"https://shared.akam